00:26:51,680 --> 00:26:57,600
Well, and it's just I think the impact of being featured because to your earlier point about, I think fewer people are searching for apps.

313
00:26:57,760 --> 00:27:06,960
And so being in a featured list in the app store is not as the is not the thing that it used to be that I remember the first time I got featured in the app store and it was like just.

314
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:09,280
It was just it was it was it was completely mind bending.

315
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:10,720
So we went from like, more.

316
00:27:10,800 --> 00:27:18,720
Yeah, we lasted a week and I went from, you know, maybe I was having like in the tens of downloads a day to suddenly I'm having like tens of thousands of downloads a day.

317
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:23,440
And it was just like, completely mind bending, but that's not the reality anymore.

