00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:35,840
Because as an independent developer where every penny I spend is money that's not going into my pocket, I spent tens of thousands, probably over well over $100,000 on design over the last 13 years.

328
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:40,240
And from what I understand, you've spent very little.

