00:39:43,920 --> 00:40:00,240
having that kind of data to back up my choices and making sure that, you know, it's like I, I, if I'm doing a design, I'll optimize it for that and then adjust it for the other ones rather than going the other way around or if I'm doing screenshots for the app store, I make sure that my screenshots are perfect for that one.

